```

---

```
list.fold(xs: List(a), init: b, f: Fn(b, a) -> b) -> b
```

Reduces a list to a single value. Starts with `init`, then calls `f(acc, elem)`
for each element.

```silt
import list

fn main() {
  let sum = [1, 2, 3] |> list.fold(0) { acc, x -> acc + x }
  println(sum) -- 6
}
```
> hover 14:15
```silt
Fn(String, type a) -> Result(a, JsonError)
